[2026-07-07] Fixed all 16 bugs across Phases 1-3 — backend, frontend, and UX
Files: backend/core/views.py, backend/core/signals.py, backend/config/settings.py, backend/requirements.txt, backend/notifications/views.py, frontend/src/app/login/page.tsx, frontend/src/app/page.tsx, frontend/src/lib/api.ts, frontend/src/context/CartContext.tsx, frontend/src/components/NavActions.tsx, frontend/src/components/NotificationBell.tsx
Decisions:
- Purchase signal rewritten with pre_save to capture old status; post_save checks for PENDING→PAID transition — only way to reliably detect status changes in Django ORM
- Stripe order lookup changed from (session.payment_intent or session.id) to always session.id; payment_intent is null at creation time for Checkout Sessions
- handle_checkout_completion stripped of manual eco points code; signal now handles all eco points awarding to avoid double-counting
- debug_config endpoint gated behind DEBUG=True check instead of being removed entirely — still useful for local debugging
- console EmailBackend removed from override position; now conditional on DEBUG so SMTP fires in production
- api.ts baseURL changed to template literal so NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL is always the bare host and /api is always appended — eliminates localhost vs production inconsistency
- Cart deduplication uses item.id equality — correct for a marketplace where each physical item is unique
- mark_all_read added as a POST action to NotificationViewSet; NotificationBell only calls it when there are actual unread items (avoids unnecessary requests)
- NavActions eco points hidden when user is not logged in (ecoPoints null) — avoids a flash of 0 before data loads

