- Design direction (user-approved): cool paper-white palette (#FBFBF9 canvas, #0B0B0C ink, #1A47E8 accent — every pairing WCAG-contrast-computed, not eyeballed), editorial serif (Fraunces) + grotesk (Geist, already loaded) typography, and a strict glass rule: dark-tinted glass only over photography/scrims, never over the bare paper canvas (max 3 glass surfaces/view)
