- Fixed a second, expected-but-real test break: H8's transaction.on_commit meant test_emails_sent_on_paid stopped seeing any email calls, because pytest-django wraps each test in a transaction that's rolled back (on_commit callbacks never fire without a real commit). Fixed with pytest-django's django_capture_on_commit_callbacks(execute=True) fixture, not a production-code workaround
