- H6 — new ThrottledTokenObtainPairView(TokenObtainPairView) with throttle_classes=[LoginRateThrottle], wired at /api/token/ in place of the bare DRF view. LoginRateThrottle (5/min) already existed and was wired to GoogleLogin, but never to the actual password-login path — the one brute-force targets
